@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3001
@token = paste_access_token_here
@refresh = paste_refresh_token_here
@etag = paste_response_etag_here

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Available demo students
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/demo/profiles

### Create a demo session; copy data.access_token into the token variable
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/demo/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{"profile":"demo-a","remember":true}

### Silently renew a remembered device
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/session/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token":"{{refresh}}"}

### Today's Shanghai schedule and rotation day
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Courses / display labels
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Current week
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calendar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### All available grades and assessment records
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/grades
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check all module versions (also accepts If-None-Match)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/offline/versions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Download a complete changed attendance dataset
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/offline/data
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":"paste_data_version_from_manifest","parts":["attendance"]}

### Per-course grade check for earlier clients
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/grades/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Recheck using the saved version and per-course revisions
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/grades/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":"paste_saved_book_version","known":{"demo-a-c0":"paste_saved_course_revision"}}

### Attendance in the available demo window
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Daily attendance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/attendance?category=daily
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Activity attendance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/attendance?category=activity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/work?kind=task&work_type=practice&task_mode=online&limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Exams
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/work?kind=exam
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Calculated task score rates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/work-statistics?kind=task
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Exam rates per subject; select a term from grades.data.available_terms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/work-statistics?kind=exam
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Evaluations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/work?kind=evaluation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Shared resources
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resources?scope=shared
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Personal resources
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resources?scope=personal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revalidate the same grades snapshot using its ETag
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/grades
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-None-Match: {{etag}}

### Hypothetical percentage; no school grade changes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/grades/project-score
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"current":88,"assessment":95,"weight":0.3}

### Revoke this session
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/session
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
